      <div type="layout" source="#source-604-825" style="padding-inline-start: 2em">
        <p><seg source="#source-625-634">○広沢</seg><seg type="annotated-text" source="#source-640-691"><seg source="#source-634-640">先生</seg><note type="gloss"><seg source="#source-664-676">（兵助）</seg></note></seg><seg source="#source-691-703">及、山田</seg><seg type="annotated-text" source="#source-709-766"><seg source="#source-703-709">先生</seg><note type="gloss"><seg source="#source-733-751">（宇右衛門）</seg></note></seg><seg source="#source-766-825">の方にも万々よろしく御頼申上候。再拝。</seg></p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p><seg source="#source-825-855">改年賀事御同意御儀奉</seg><note type="kunten" subtype="return-mark" rend="subscript" source="#source-855-867">レ</note><seg source="#source-867-878">存候。</seg></p>
        <p><seg source="#source-878-1028">然ニ御別後三田尻の方ニ出かけんとする所、井上兄より御咄置候て、すぐ下の関ニ罷帰り申候。兼而御示の如く</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1028-1064"><rb>越荷方</rb><rt>（こしにかた）</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1064-1139">久保松太先生に御目ニ懸り、止宿の所お御頼、則チ阿弥</seg><seg type="annotated-text" source="#source-1142-1187"><seg source="#source-1139-1142">太</seg><note type="gloss"><seg source="#source-1163-1172">（陀）</seg></note></seg><seg source="#source-1187-1280">寺伊藤助太夫方ニ相成申候。是より近日長崎ニ参り、又此地ニ帰リ可</seg><note type="kunten" subtype="return-mark" rend="subscript" source="#source-1280-1292">レ</note><seg source="#source-1292-1370">申と存居申候。何レ其の節又々御咄もうかゞい候。先ハ早</seg><g ref="#gaiji-1-2-22" source="#source-1370-1403">〻</g><seg source="#source-1403-1420">、拝稽首。</seg></p>
      </div>
      <div type="layout" source="#source-1420-1479" style="padding-inline-start: 2em">
        <p><seg source="#source-1441-1453">正月三日</seg><seg type="layout" source="#source-1453-1479" rend="chitsuki align(right) offset-from-end(0)" snh:layout-kind="chitsuki" snh:layout-params="align=right;offset-from-end=0"><seg source="#source-1471-1479">龍馬</seg></seg></p>
      </div>
      <div type="layout" source="#source-1479-1514" style="padding-inline-start: 3em">
        <p><seg source="#source-1500-1514">木圭先生</seg></p>
      </div>
      <div type="layout" source="#source-1514-1543" style="padding-inline-start: 7em">
        <p><seg source="#source-1535-1543">足下</seg></p>
      </div>
      <div type="layout" source="#source-1543-1762" style="padding-inline-start: 1em">
        <p><seg source="#source-1578-1623">追白、井上氏ニ送リ候手紙、御面</seg><seg type="annotated-text" source="#source-1626-1671"><seg source="#source-1623-1626">遠</seg><note type="gloss"><seg source="#source-1647-1656">（倒）</seg></note></seg><seg source="#source-1671-1712">ながらよろしく御頼申上候。</seg></p>
        <p><seg source="#source-1712-1726">木圭先生</seg></p>
      </div>
      <div type="layout" source="#source-1764-1815" style="padding-inline-start: 3em">
        <p><seg source="#source-1785-1794">虎皮下</seg><seg type="layout" source="#source-1794-1815" rend="chitsuki align(right) offset-from-end(0)" snh:layout-kind="chitsuki" snh:layout-params="align=right;offset-from-end=0"><seg source="#source-1812-1815">龍</seg></seg></p>
      </div>
